{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"08e81403-88fb-4da6-9d81-c273ee498368","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Torque measures a force’s turning effect about a pivot. Here, an upward force acts at the end of a rigid arm.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Torque about a pivot"},{"op":"figure","id":"lever","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-0.6,4.1],"y":[-0.9,4.2],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"pivot","at":[0,0],"label":"pivot"},{"kind":"segment","id":"rod","from":{"at":"pivot"},"to":[3,2]},{"kind":"point","id":"tip","at":[3,2]},{"kind":"segment","id":"force","from":{"at":"tip"},"to":[3,3.8],"arrow":true,"label":"10 N"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"08e81403-88fb-4da6-9d81-c273ee498368","step":{"id":"s2","script":"The lever arm is the perpendicular distance from the pivot to the force’s line of action—not the length of the rigid arm.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"distance","on":"lever","marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"action","from":[3,-0.7],"to":[3,4],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"point","id":"foot","at":{"foot":"pivot","onto":"action"}},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"pivot"},"to":{"at":"foot"},"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"foot"},"from":{"at":"tip"},"to":{"at":"pivot"}},{"kind":"measure","from":[0,-0.5],"to":[3,-0.5],"label":"d = 3 m"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"rule","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|\\tau|=Fd_{\\perp}"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Which distance belongs in the torque formula: the rigid arm’s length or the perpendicular distance to the force’s line?","expected_gist":"The perpendicular distance from the pivot to the force’s line of action."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"08e81403-88fb-4da6-9d81-c273ee498368","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Multiply force by the perpendicular lever arm: thirty newton-meters. The upward force on the right tends to turn the arm counterclockwise.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"result","anchor":{"el":"rule","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|\\tau|=(10\\,\\mathrm{N})(3\\,\\mathrm{m})=30\\,\\mathrm{N\\,m}"},{"op":"figure","id":"turn","on":"lever","marks":[{"kind":"arc","center":{"at":"pivot"},"r":0.8,"start":40,"end":145,"arrow":true},{"kind":"text","at":[1.1,3.3],"text":"counterclockwise","size":"small"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
